================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY WEBASSEMBLY ENGINE & CODEC NOTICE
================================================================================

Stator's application source code, UI components, and local Canvas/Web Worker
pipelines are licensed under the MIT License above.

For browser-based video and audio transcoding, Stator dynamically loads
@ffmpeg/core WebAssembly binaries at runtime. Standard @ffmpeg/core builds
include FFmpeg and optional encoders such as libx264, which are licensed under
the GNU General Public License (GPL v2 or later) or LGPL depending on the
loaded WebAssembly core build. Users and redistributors bundling @ffmpeg/core
artifacts directly must comply with the applicable FFmpeg and codec licenses.
